        "columns": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "order": 0,
            "content": "<h2>Slow bread, made the long way</h2><p>Every loaf starts with a starter we have fed daily for over a decade, a 36-hour cold ferment, and flour milled within a day's drive of the shop. It takes longer. The crust is darker, the crumb is open, and the bread keeps for days.</p>",
