        ],
        "items": [
          {
            "content": "<h3>Country sourdough</h3><p>Our everyday loaf: wheat, a little whole rye, water, salt and time.</p>",
            "media": "0ca422ea-42aa-5c10-907a-5c4b97497c5b"
          },
          {
            "content": "<h3>Morning pastries</h3><p>Croissants, cardamom buns and a rotating fruit danish, laminated by hand.</p>",
            "media": "851bb512-db3c-543c-861b-4a96e6ffe935"
          },
          {
            "content": "<h3>Seasonal cakes</h3><p>Whole cakes to order with two days' notice, slices at the counter daily.</p>",
            "media": "b4e9100a-18fc-5778-a0b9-16294cff5837"
          }
